{"book":"lunyu","id":"sishu.lunyu.04","index":4,"passages":[{"editorial_status":"unverified-draft","id":"sishu.lunyu.04.01","number":1,"ruby_paragraphs":[[{"pinyin":"zǐ","traditional":"子","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"yuē","traditional":"曰","type":"ruby"},{"type":"text","value":"：“"},{"pinyin":"lǐ","traditional":"里","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"rén","traditional":"仁","type":"ruby"},{"modern":"为","pinyin":"wèi","traditional":"為","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"měi","traditional":"美","type":"ruby"},{"type":"text","value":"，"},{"modern":"择","pinyin":"zé","traditional":"擇","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"bù","traditional":"不","type":"ruby"},{"modern":"处","pinyin":"chù","traditional":"處","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"rén","traditional":"仁","type":"ruby"},{"type":"text","value":"，"},{"pinyin":"yān","traditional":"焉","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"dé","traditional":"得","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"zhī","traditional":"知","type":"ruby"},{"type":"text","value":"？”"}]],"translation_indonesian":"Nabi bersabda, \"Bertempat tinggal dekat tempat kediaman orang yang berperi Cinta Kasih, itulah yang sebaik-baiknya. Bila tidak mau memilih tempat yang disuasanai Cinta Kasih itu, bagaimana memperoleh Kebijaksanaan?\" (Bc. IIA. 7/2).","translation_english":"The Master said, 'It is virtuous manners which constitute the excellence of a neighborhood. If a man in selecting a residence, do not fix on one where such prevail, how can he be wise?'","translation_english_source":"https://www.gutenberg.org/ebooks/4094","translation_english_alignment":"chapter-count-exact; needs editorial collation"},{"editorial_status":"unverified-draft","id":"sishu.lunyu.04.02","number":2,"ruby_paragraphs":[[{"pinyin":"zǐ","traditional":"子","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"yuē","traditional":"曰","type":"ruby"},{"type":"text","value":"：“"},{"pinyin":"bù","traditional":"不","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"rén","traditional":"仁","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"zhě","traditional":"者","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"bù","traditional":"不","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"kě","traditional":"可","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"yǐ","traditional":"以","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"jiǔ","traditional":"久","type":"ruby"},{"modern":"处","pinyin":"chù","traditional":"處","type":"ruby"},{"modern":"约","pinyin":"yuē","traditional":"約","type":"ruby"},{"type":"text","value":"，"},{"pinyin":"bù","traditional":"不","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"kě","traditional":"可","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"yǐ","traditional":"以","type":"ruby"},{"modern":"长","pinyin":"zhǎng","traditional":"長","type":"ruby"},{"modern":"处","pinyin":"chù","traditional":"處","type":"ruby"},{"modern":"乐","pinyin":"lè","traditional":"樂","type":"ruby"},{"type":"text","value":"。"},{"pinyin":"rén","traditional":"仁","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"zhě","traditional":"者","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"ān","traditional":"安","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"rén","traditional":"仁","type":"ruby"},{"type":"text","value":"，"},{"pinyin":"zhī","traditional":"知","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"zhě","traditional":"者","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"lì","traditional":"利","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"rén","traditional":"仁","type":"ruby"},{"type":"text","value":"。”"}]],"translation_indonesian":"Nabi bersabda, \"Seorang yang tidak berperi Cinta Kasih, tidak tahan lama di dalam penderitaan, dan tidak tahan lama di dalam kesenangan. Seorang yang berperi Cinta Kasih, merasakan sentosa di dalam Cinta Kasih dan seorang yang Bijaksana, merasakan beruntung di dalam Cinta Kasih.\" (S.S. XV. 9).","translation_english":"The Master said, 'Those who are without virtue cannot abide long either in a condition of poverty and hardship, or in a condition of enjoyment. The virtuous rest in virtue; the wise desire virtue.'","translation_english_source":"https://www.gutenberg.org/ebooks/4094","translation_english_alignment":"chapter-count-exact; needs editorial collation"},{"editorial_status":"unverified-draft","id":"sishu.lunyu.04.03","number":3,"ruby_paragraphs":[[{"pinyin":"zǐ","traditional":"子","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"yuē","traditional":"曰","type":"ruby"},{"type":"text","value":"：“"},{"pinyin":"wéi","traditional":"唯","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"rén","traditional":"仁","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"zhě","traditional":"者","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"néng","traditional":"能","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"hǎo","traditional":"好","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"rén","traditional":"人","type":"ruby"},{"type":"text","value":"，"},{"pinyin":"néng","traditional":"能","type":"ruby"},{"modern":"恶","pinyin":"è","traditional":"惡","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"rén","traditional":"人","type":"ruby"},{"type":"text","value":"。”"}]],"translation_indonesian":"Nabi bersabda, \"Hanya seorang yang penuh Cinta Kasih saja dapat mencintai dan membenci orang.\" (A.B. X 15).","translation_english":"The Master said, 'It is only the (truly) virtuous man, who can love, or who can hate, others.'","translation_english_source":"https://www.gutenberg.org/ebooks/4094","translation_english_alignment":"chapter-count-exact; needs editorial collation"},{"editorial_status":"unverified-draft","id":"sishu.lunyu.04.04","number":4,"ruby_paragraphs":[[{"pinyin":"zǐ","traditional":"子","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"yuē","traditional":"曰","type":"ruby"},{"type":"text","value":"：“"},{"pinyin":"gǒu","traditional":"苟","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"zhì","traditional":"志","type":"ruby"},{"modern":"于","pinyin":"yú","traditional":"於","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"rén","traditional":"仁","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"yǐ","traditional":"矣","type":"ruby"},{"type":"text","value":"，"},{"modern":"无","pinyin":"wú","traditional":"無","type":"ruby"},{"modern":"恶","pinyin":"è","traditional":"惡","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"yě","traditional":"也","type":"ruby"},{"type":"text","value":"。”"}]],"translation_indonesian":"Nabi bersabda, \"Bila cipta selalu ditujukan kepada Cinta Kasih, tiada sarang bagi kejahatan.\" (S.S. XIV: 6)","translation_english":"The Master said, 'If the will be set on virtue, there will be no practice of wickedness.'","translation_english_source":"https://www.gutenberg.org/ebooks/4094","translation_english_alignment":"chapter-count-exact;