pe":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"dé","traditional":"得","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"zhī","traditional":"之","type":"ruby"},{"type":"text","value":"，"},{"pinyin":"bù","traditional":"不","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"qù","traditional":"去","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"yě","traditional":"也","type":"ruby"},{"type":"text","value":"。"},{"pinyin":"jūn","traditional":"君","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"zǐ","traditional":"子","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"qù","traditional":"去","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"rén","traditional":"仁","type":"ruby"},{"type":"text","value":"，"},{"modern":"恶","pinyin":"è","traditional":"惡","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"hū","traditional":"乎","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"chéng","traditional":"成","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"míng","traditional":"名","type":"ruby"},{"type":"text","value":"？"},{"pinyin":"jūn","traditional":"君","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"zǐ","traditional":"子","type":"ruby"},{"modern":"无","pinyin":"wú","traditional":"無","type":"ruby"},{"modern":"终","pinyin":"zhōng","traditional":"終","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"shí","traditional":"食","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"zhī","traditional":"之","type":"ruby"},{"modern":"间","pinyin":"jiān","traditional":"間","type":"ruby"},{"modern":"违","pinyin":"wéi","traditional":"違","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"rén","traditional":"仁","type":"ruby"},{"type":"text","value":"，"},{"pinyin":"zào","traditional":"造","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"cì","traditional":"次","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"bì","traditional":"必","type":"ruby"},{"modern":"于","pinyin":"yú","traditional":"於","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"shì","traditional":"是","type":"ruby"},{"type":"text","value":"，"},{"modern":"颠","pinyin":"diān","traditional":"顛","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"pèi","traditional":"沛","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"bì","traditional":"必","type":"ruby"},{"modern":"于","pinyin":"yú","traditional":"於","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"shì","traditional":"是","type":"ruby"},{"type":"text","value":"。”"}]],"translation_indonesian":"Nabi bersabda, \"Kaya dan berkedudukan mulia ialah keinginan tiap orang, tetapi bila tidak dapat dicapai dengan Jalan Suci, janganlah ditempati. Miskin dan berkedudukan rendah ialah kebencian tiap orang, tetapi bila tidak dapat disingkiri dengan Jalan Suci, janganlah ditinggalkan. (2) \"Seorang Junzi - Kuncu bila meninggalkan Cinta Kasih, bagaimanakah memperoleh sebutan itu? (3) \"Seorang Junzi - Kuncu sekalipun sesaat makan tidak melanggar Cinta Kasih; di dalam kesibukan juga demikian, bahkan di dalam topan dan bahayapun ia tetap demikian.\"","translation_english":"1. The Master said, 'Riches and honours are what men desire. If it cannot be obtained in the proper way, they should not be held. Poverty and meanness are what men dislike. If it cannot be avoided in the proper way, they should not be avoided. 2. 'If a superior man abandon virtue, how can he fulfil the requirements of that name? 3. 'The superior man does not, even for the space of a single meal, act contrary to virtue. In moments of haste, he cleaves to it. In seasons of danger, he cleaves to it.'","translation_english_source":"https://www.gutenberg.org/ebooks/4094","translation_english_alignment":"chapter-count-exact; needs editorial collation"},{"editorial_status":"unverified-draft","id":"sishu.lunyu.04.06","number":6,"ruby_paragraphs":[[{"pinyin":"zǐ","traditional":"子","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"yuē","traditional":"曰","type":"ruby"},{"type":"text","value":"：“"},{"pinyin":"wǒ","traditional":"我","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"wèi","traditional":"未","type":"ruby"},{"modern":"见","pinyin":"jiàn","traditional":"見","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"hǎo","traditional":"好","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"rén","traditional":"仁","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"zhě","traditional":"者","type":"ruby"},{"type":"text","value":"，"},{"modern":"恶","pinyin":"è","traditional":"惡","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"bù","traditional":"不","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"rén","traditional":"仁","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"zhě","traditional":"者","type":"ruby"},{"type":"text","value":"。"},{"pinyin":"hǎo","traditional":"好","type":"ruby"},{"pinyin":"rén","traditional":"仁"